<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-maymyo">Battle of Maymyo</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Maymyo was fought in early 1768 near Maymyo, now Pyin Oo Lwin, in Upper Burma during the third Qing invasion of the Sino-Burmese War.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Treaty</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-gottorp">Treaty of Gottorp</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Treaty of Gottorp, concluded in 1768, settled Hamburg's long dispute with Denmark, whose kings as dukes of Holstein had claimed sovereignty over the city.</p></div></li></ol></section>
